WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:03.740
I'm returning my red iPhone.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.000
And this red case.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.980
Now before we get into the specifics of why,

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.960
A lot of people, I was actually quite surprise,

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:10.460
In the comment, had no idea that

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:12.000
RED is actually a charity.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.420
And they've been around for quite a while.

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:15.160
Apple has been partnering with them for 10 years,

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:18.380
And this phone, was actually a 10-year celebration

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:19.320
Of working with them.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:22.400
Apple in total had donated 130 Million Dollars

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.400
To the RED foundation.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:26.220
The entire charity has raised 465 million,

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:28.840
Which make Apple one of their leading donor.

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.200
Now I've no idea what the specifics are,

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.100
The Percentage of the iPhone sales

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.780
Or cases, or how that all works.

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:37.040
Technically, this phone is for charity

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:41.700
And I don't know how much is actually going to RED.

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:43.780
And if you're not familiar with RED as a charity,

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:47.700
It's an HIV and AIDS prevention treatment counselling

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:49.160
And they also have a very specific focus,

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:52.380
On eliminating transmission from mom to child

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:55.040
Which, is kind of powerful.

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:57.700
And here I am, buying a silly iPhone,

00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:59.780
For the sake of the color, granted yes,

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:01.700
I did know a portion is going to charity

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:03.260
Which that's absolutely incredible.

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:05.280
But then I'm thinking, now I'm returning it,

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:08.000
So does that mean I'm taking that little bit

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.440
Of the percentage away from the charity

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:11.180
That I just technically sort of donated to?

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:12.380
Yeah.

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:14.800
And for a very silly, superficial reason,

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:15.900
And the reason I'm returning it,

00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:18.660
Is simply because, I just realize,

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:20.060
That I don't like the color red.

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:21.420
Like, at all.

00:01:21.420 --> 00:01:24.140
I like it as, sort of an accented color to things,

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:26.500
But just for a simple color in whole,

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:28.000
So I've been a graphics designer for quite a long time,

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.420
So I absolutely love colors,

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:33.360
And the way of different colors can make people feel,

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:35.700
And red does not make me have a very good feeling.

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:37.360
At all.I do not like it.

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:38.560
I was looking at my Instagram feed,

00:01:39.020 --> 00:01:43.060
My YouTube thumbnail, after a past couple of days

00:01:43.060 --> 00:01:43.680
Of me making videos about the phone,

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:44.960
And it just hit me like

00:01:44.960 --> 00:01:46.800
This phone does not actually make me happy.

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:49.920
My Jet Black phone made me really happy.

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:51.820
It still make me happy, and I really like it,

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:53.020
And it's a prefectly great phone.

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:54.960
So this is what I decided to do,

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:56.020
I decided to return the phone,

00:01:56.020 --> 00:01:57.940
And then donate the entire portion

00:01:57.940 --> 00:02:00.340
Of what I paid for this phone, to RED.

00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:02.520
So I think that's a much better use

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:06.200
Of the money I paid for this phone.

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:07.760
I mean, I bought this phone,

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:09.760
So I'll get that money back,

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:13.220
And I'm gonna donate it, to RED. Simple as that.

00:02:13.220 --> 00:02:15.120
I just wish I knew what percentage of this

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:16.540
Actually went to charity.

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:17.760
But now at least I know that,

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:20.140
Basically 100% of what I paid for,

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:22.440
Is now going to actually help people.

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:24.880
Sigh. So that's my reason,

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:26.620
On why I'm returning it. It's simply because

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:27.500
I don't like the color.

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:29.360
And it's crazy cause I ran into a bunch of people

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:30.260
Who saw my video and they were so excited

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:31.200
To show me their phone,

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:33.180
'Look I got it!' I was like, it looks good.

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:34.180
It looks incredible.

00:02:34.180 --> 00:02:35.520
Also I want to address,

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:37.500
A lot of you guys said, Justine, just get a clear case.

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:38.700
Then that will alleviate the problem

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:41.700
If you want to see the phone's color.

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:43.960
I don't like clear cases.At all.

00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:45.860
I've had them before, I've had them in the past,

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:48.080
With travelling, going to crazy shoots,

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:49.060
Random destinations,

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:50.680
I never really know where I'm gonna end up,

00:02:50.680 --> 00:02:52.100
From a day to day basis,

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:56.040
I can just tell you that clear cases, get really disgusting.

00:02:56.040 --> 00:02:57.960
Stuff get stuck in between it,

00:02:58.180 --> 00:02:59.480
And it's trapped there,

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:01.440
So not only are you looking at your phone,

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:03.760
But you're looking at all of the dirt that your phone

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:05.600
Has come in contacted and it's trapped in there.

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:07.420
And it's not a pretty site.

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:08.340
Correct me if I'm wrong,

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:10.760
Or if you guys have a case, that's clear and perfect,

00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:12.720
and no dirt gets in, let me know what it is.

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:14.500
Because that's a magical case.

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:16.440
I also feel so bad,

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:17.360
Because I made that video,

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:18.700
And the bunch of my friends was like,

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:19.940
Justine I got the red phone cause you said

00:03:19.940 --> 00:03:20.580
it was so cool!

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:24.020
It is cool, I think this is an absolutely,

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:25.700
beautiful phone.

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:28.660
It looks so good, I just don't like the color red.

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:31.620
That's it, everything about it, I love this phone.

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:33.260
You already knew it, I like the phone.

00:03:33.260 --> 00:03:34.340
That's nothing new.

00:03:34.340 --> 00:03:35.740
I'm keeping the other red case that I got,

00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:37.840
And the Apple Watch band because they match

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:39.640
perfectly, so this just didn't make me happy.

00:03:39.640 --> 00:03:42.540
So I would much rather take that money that I have,

00:03:42.540 --> 00:03:45.000
And hopefully change somebody else's life

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:47.060
And make somebody else way more happy.

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:48.740
Then this phone could've made me

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:50.940
That's it.I'll see you guys later.

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:52.240
Hope you guys have a great day.

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:54.680
I'm gonna now return it now. See ya!

00:03:55.200 --> 00:04:14.860
~Preview of old videos~

